  "description": "Meet the Cyrusher Sprint — your smart and stylish partner for urban commuting and daily errands. Designed for comfort, safety, and seamless performance, the Sprint redefines city riding.\n\nUpright Geometry & Step‑Through Frame\nEasy on/off access and a relaxed, upright riding position ensure maximum comfort—whether you're heading to work, running errands, or just cruising the neighborhood.\n\nDual Sensor Modes: Torque + Cadence\nCustomize your ride: enjoy responsive torque-sensing for hill climbs or switch to smooth, effortless cadence mode for flat cruising.\n\nPremium LG Battery + Reliable Electronics\nA high-capacity 48V 15Ah LG 21700 battery delivers up to 60-mile range on a single charge. Built with UL/CE-certified wiring systems for safety and durability.\n\nPowerful & Smooth Performance\nDriven by a robust 750W motor (87 Nm torque), the Sprint offers peppy acceleration and confident speed for city streets.\n\nTrusted Components with Safety in Mind\nDual-piston Tektro hydraulic disc brakes with motor cutoff provide dependable stopping in any weather.\n\nVisibility & Ride Comfort\nEquipped with reflective tires, integrated lighting, and dual suspension, the Sprint ensures a secure and smooth ride—even on rough urban roads.\n\nCapable & Commuter-Ready Build\nHandles up to 330 lb payload, with adjustable stem and frame to fit riders from ~5'7\" to ~6'7\".\n\nWhy You’ll Love the Sprint:\n\nIt adapts to your pace—whether you want an effortless glide or a workout. Bright, comfortable, and built for real-life riding, the Sprint turns your city commute into a joyride.",
